| F1 | open | BLOCKING | .github/workflows/ci.yml | 🚨 blocking required check red — core tests shard 3 4 on head 7724b73b ci run 44302537475 https github com istin flutter agent harness actions runs 44302537475 job 134797159293 fails this job s shard ci failures full log 2169 2173 ❌ test dispatch watch test dart gh 1903 — orphan cancel fires only when the leg dies int manual workflow cancel with a never started child → the same single orphan cancel timeoutexception after 0 00 30 000000 test timed out after 30 seconds bad state process did not exit after signal — diagnostics 3863 tests passed 1 failed 7 skipped diagnosis — the red is not caused by this bump the pr diff is 11 workflow yamls 34 −34 action pin replacement only test dispatch watch test dart and scripts dispatch and watch sh the script under test are untouched by it and the workflow yaml is not an input to that test — it spawns the script locally against stub gh fixtures and races a sigint trap handoff the exact failure signature is a documented flake class in the test file itself test dispatch watch test dart 392 411 — the dwlive finish budget comment on a starved runner that handoff has outlived 15s hostile ambient env red on commit b93d825b … in the int orphan cancel test test dispatch watch test dart 1170 1180 — the finish wedge regression test cites commit b93d825b ci job 122558113139 dying with the same bad state process did not exit after signal today s red on 7724b73b is that identical wedge signature → the test now has reds on ≥2 distinct sha runs b93d825b 7724b73b which meets the repo s flake quarantine bar scripts test quarantine json gh 1199 ac6 — quarantine triage is the keeper s call not this pr s note this is the second main side red carried onto this pr s checks by the main into branch merges round 1 the headless chrome suite root caused to gh 2103 and fixed by 2283 resolution the pr ships no dart code so no change in it can fix the shard the check must simply be green before merge — hence request changes despite the bump itself being verified clean all 11 refs → the same 2286a0c v1 8 2 release commit v1 comments and sdk inputs including the gh 2120 pinned 3 13 5 jobs untouched zero stale 6afc89d refs anywhere in the repo re run shard 3 4 or merge main s next hardening and this converges if the same wedge reds again on another distinct sha route the int orphan cancel test to quarantine triage on main |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

